WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Tobias Weber>Morning. Standup for Tuesday 6 October. Ingrid, go ahead.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>Morning. The BMS state-of-charge drift is fixed in build 3. The estimate now stays inside the band over a full discharge.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:58.000
<v Tobias Weber>Is that the same bug as the cold-start jump from 8 September?

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:18.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>Same one. The cold-start jump is gone too, after the change to the reset logic.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:38.000
<v Felix Neumann>I can confirm the app shows the right value on the test bike.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:58.000
<v Tobias Weber>Ingrid, anything else on the BMS?

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:18.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>Yes. The BMS thermal cutoff test passed on Friday. The pack shut down at the set limit and came back cleanly after cooling.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:38.000
<v Tobias Weber>Was that on the rig or on a bike?

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:58.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>The rig first, then one bike in the shop. Same result both times.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:18.000
<v Tobias Weber>Great. Felix, status on the firmware.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:38.000
<v Felix Neumann>Firmware 0.9 is ready for release. The OTA rollback passed on all three bench units.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:58.000
<v Tobias Weber>Is the changelog done?

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:18.000
<v Felix Neumann>Almost. I will send the release notes to the team once they are final.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:38.000
<v Tobias Weber>Any blockers for the release?

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:58.000
<v Felix Neumann>Only the signing step, which I have scheduled for Wednesday.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:18.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>I will run the balancing check on build 3 again tomorrow, so we have it on record.

17
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:38.000
<v Tobias Weber>Good. Keep the rig booked for that.

18
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:58.000
<v Ingrid Kowalski>Will do.

19
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:18.000
<v Tobias Weber>Anything else? No, I think we are done for the week on the BMS side.

20
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:38.000
<v Felix Neumann>Nothing from me. Thanks.
